flowchart TD
    START([Client Request]) --> VALIDATE{Validate<br/>User IDs}

    VALIDATE -->|Invalid| ERROR_INVALID[Throw Error:<br/>Invalid User IDs]
    VALIDATE -->|Self-Relationship| ERROR_SELF[Throw Error:<br/>Cannot follow self]
    VALIDATE -->|Valid| RATE_LIMIT{Check<br/>Rate Limit}

    RATE_LIMIT -->|Exceeded| ERROR_RATE[Throw Error:<br/>Rate Limit]
    RATE_LIMIT -->|OK| CHECK_EXISTING{Existing<br/>Relationship?}

    CHECK_EXISTING -->|Yes & Active| RETURN_EXISTING[Return Existing<br/>Idempotent]
    CHECK_EXISTING -->|No| CHECK_BLOCK{Check<br/>Blocks}

    CHECK_BLOCK -->|Blocked| ERROR_BLOCKED[Throw Error:<br/>Blocked]
    CHECK_BLOCK -->|Not Blocked| CHECK_PRIVACY{Check<br/>Privacy Settings}

    CHECK_PRIVACY -->|Requires Approval| CREATE_PENDING[Create Pending<br/>Relationship]
    CHECK_PRIVACY -->|Public Account| CREATE_ACTIVE[Create Active<br/>Relationship]

    CREATE_PENDING --> UPDATE_GRAPH_PENDING[Skip Graph Update]
    CREATE_ACTIVE --> UPDATE_GRAPH[Update Graph<br/>Add Bidirectional Links]

    UPDATE_GRAPH_PENDING --> INVALIDATE_CACHE
    UPDATE_GRAPH --> INVALIDATE_CACHE[Invalidate<br/>Cache Patterns]

    INVALIDATE_CACHE --> EMIT_EVENT[Emit Domain Event<br/>user.followed]

    EMIT_EVENT --> UPDATE_METRICS[Update Metrics<br/>Counters]

    UPDATE_METRICS --> LOG[Log Success]

    LOG --> RETURN[Return Relationship]

    ERROR_INVALID --> END([End])
    ERROR_SELF --> END
    ERROR_RATE --> END
    ERROR_BLOCKED --> END
    RETURN_EXISTING --> END
    RETURN --> END

    style START fill:#50C878,stroke:#2E7D32,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    style RETURN fill:#50C878,stroke:#2E7D32,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    style ERROR_INVALID fill:#E74C3C,stroke:#C0392B,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    style ERROR_SELF fill:#E74C3C,stroke:#C0392B,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    style ERROR_RATE fill:#E74C3C,stroke:#C0392B,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    style ERROR_BLOCKED fill:#E74C3C,stroke:#C0392B,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    style UPDATE_GRAPH fill:#9370DB,stroke:#6B4B9C,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    style EMIT_EVENT fill:#4A90E2,stroke:#2E5C8A,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
